Sat Oct 31 11:00:00 UTC 2026 - Andreas Røsdal <andreas.rosdal@gmail.com>

- Initial openSUSE package of Nordstjernen 1.0.39, a small web browser
  written from scratch in C with a GTK 4 UI and a libcurl network stack.
- Built from git via the OBS scm bridge (scmsync); WebGPU disabled
  (needs external wgpu-native), WebAssembly disabled on 32-bit x86.
